Subject: [PATCH 752/913] dts: stm32: add system-power-controller for stpmic1
 in stm32mp135f-dk

Use the new properties "system-power-controller" in the
stm32mp135f-dk device tree to prepare removal of "system_off_soc".

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 2a5d9d4a0e6aa5d4f2a4db010f2e035ff2c4fea7 dts: stm32: add system-power-controller for stpmic1 in stm32mp135f-dk]
